INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('toilahuongg/Shopify-Agents-Kit/shopify-metafields', 'shopify-metafields', 'toilahuongg', 'Shopify-Agents-Kit', 'community', 'shopify-metafields toilahuongg Shopify-Agents-Kit community Shopify-metafields allows developers to store additional data on Shopify resources, enhancing customization and flexibility for e-commerce applications. It benefits developers and businesses seeking to extend Shopify''s default schema. Shopify Metafields 允许您在 Shopify 资源上存储额外的数据，包括产品、订单、客户和店铺，通过命名空间、键、类型和所有者实现灵活的数据管理 Shopify Metafields を使用すると、Shopify リソース（製品、注文、顧客、ショップ）に追加のデータを保存できます。ネームスペース、キー、タイプ、オーナーを使用して柔軟なデータ管理を実現 Shopify Metafields를 사용하면 Shopify 리소스(제품, 주문, 고객, 상점)에 추가 데이터를 저장할 수 있습니다. 네임스페이스, 키, 유형, 소유자를 사용하여 유연한 데이터 관리를 구현 Los metafields de Shopify permiten almacenar datos adicionales en recursos como productos y clientes. Conoce cómo configurar y utilizar esta función. Les metafields Shopify permettent de stocker des données supplémentaires sur les ressources telles que les produits et les clients. Découvrez comment les configurer et les utiliser. Die Metafields von Shopify ermöglichen die Speicherung von zusätzlichen Daten auf Ressourcen wie Produkten und Kunden. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie diese Funktion einrichten und nutzen. Os metafields do Shopify permitem armazenar dados adicionais em recursos como produtos e pedidos Метаполя Shopify позволяют хранить дополнительные данные о продуктах, заказах и клиентах تتيح الحقول المتخصصة في شوبيفاي تخزين بيانات إضافية حول المنتجات والطلبات how to use shopify-metafields shopify-metafields setup guide what is shopify-metafields shopify-metafields vs custom attributes shopify-metafields install shopify-metafields namespace examples shopify-metafields data types shopify-metafields api documentation Shopify Metafields AIエージェント 数据存储 命名空间 键 类型 所有者 Shopify 资源 Utilizes namespaces for organized data storage Supports various data types, including single_line_text_field and json Enables custom data attachment to products, orders, and customers Allows for specific field naming using keys Stores data on Shopify resources, extending the default schema Shopify-metafields is a feature enabling the storage of custom data on Shopify resources, such as products, orders, and customers, using namespaces, keys, and data types.');
