よって問題の解決を効率化する方法です - AIエージェント","ko":"깃허브 이슈 생성은 코드베이스를 연구하고 명확한 문서를 제공하여 문제를 효율적으로 해결하는 방법입니다","es":"La creación de incidencias en GitHub es el proceso de informar y documentar problemas o mejoras en un proyecto de software","fr":"La création de problèmes GitHub est le processus de signaler et de documenter des problèmes ou des améliorations dans un projet de logiciel","de":"Die Erstellung von GitHub-Problemen ist der Prozess der Meldung und Dokumentation von Fehlern oder Verbesserungen in einem Software-Projekt","pt":"O que é criar issues no GitHub? É uma habilidade que permite criar issues claras e bem documentadas no GitHub","ru":"Что такое создание issues на GitHub? Это навык, который позволяет создавать ясные и хорошо документированные issues на GitHub","ar":"ما هي إنشاء قضايا على GitHub؟ هي مهارة تسمح بإنشاء قضايا واضحة ومدونة بشكل جيد على GitHub"},"features":{"en":["Researches codebase using Explore agent or search tools","Identifies relevant code locations, including file paths and functions","Analyzes similar functionality implementation","Examines database tables, API endpoints, and UI components","Ensures issues contain enough context for easy implementation"],"zh":["研究代码库以理解相关代码","提供清晰的文档以确保问题得到有效解决","使用Explore agent或搜索工具来理解代码库","了解数据库表、API端点或UI组件的实现"],"ja":["コードベースの調査により関連コードを理解する","明確なドキュメントを提供して問題の解決を効率化する","Exploreエージェントまたは検索ツールを使用してコードベースを理解する","データベーステーブル、APIエンドポイント、またはUIコンポーネントの実装を理解する - AIエージェント"],"ko":["코드베이스를 연구하여 관련 코드를 이해합니다","명확한 문서를 제공하여 문제를 효율적으로 해결합니다","Explore 에이전트 또는 검색 도구를 사용하여 코드베이스를 이해합니다","데이터베이스 테이블, API 엔드포인트 또는 UI 컴포넌트의 구현을 이해합니다"],"es":["Investigación del código para entender la funcionalidad existente","Uso de Tauri y React para la creación de la interfaz","Documentación clara y concisa de los problemas","Recherche de código con herramientas de búsqueda","Creación de incidencias con suficiente contexto para la implementación","Utilización de la interfaz de usuario para informar problemas"],"fr":["Recherche de code pour comprendre la fonctionnalité existante","Utilisation de Tauri et React pour la création de l''interface","Documentation claire et concise des problèmes","Recherche de code avec des outils de recherche","Création de problèmes avec suffisamment de contexte pour la mise en œuvre","Utilisation de l''interface utilisateur pour signaler des problèmes"],"de":["Code-Recherche zur Verständnis der bestehenden Funktionalität","Verwendung von Tauri und React für die Erstellung der Schnittstelle","Klare und präzise Dokumentation von Fehlern","Code-Recherche mit Suchtools","Erstellung von Problemen mit genügend Kontext für die Umsetzung","Verwendung der Benutzeroberfläche zur Meldung von Fehlern"],"pt":["Pesquisa de código no repositório","Entendimento de funcionalidades semelhantes","Documentação clara e concisa","Integração com Tauri e React","Melhoria da produtividade"],"ru":["Поиск кода в репозитории","Понимание аналогичных функций","Ясная и краткая документация","Интеграция с Tauri и React","Повышение производительности"],"ar":["بحث الكود في المستودع","فهم الوظائف المماثلة","توثيق واضح وموجز","التكامل مع Tauri و React","تحسين الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to create github issues","creating-github-issues setup guide","github issue best practices","creating-github-issues alternative","creating-github-issues vs jira","github issue template","creating-github-issues install","what is creating-github-issues","creating-github-issues tutorial"],"zh":["创建GitHub问题","代码库研究","清晰文档","Explore agent","搜索工具","数据库表","API端点","UI组件"],"ja":["GitHubイシュー作成","コードベース調査","明確なドキュメント","Exploreエージェント","検索ツール","データベーステーブル","APIエンドポイント","UIコンポーネント","AIエージェント"],"ko":["깃허브 이슈 생성","코드베이스 연구","명확한 문서","Explore 에이전트","검색 도구","데이터베이스 테이블","API 엔드포인트","UI 컴포넌트","AI 도구"],"es":["creación de incidencias en GitHub","GitHub issues","Tauri","React","investigación de código","documentación clara","interfaz de usuario","herramientas de búsqueda","creación de problemas"],"fr":["création de problèmes GitHub","GitHub issues","Tauri","React","recherche de code","documentation claire","interface utilisateur","outils de recherche","création de problèmes"],"de":["Erstellung von GitHub-Problemen","GitHub issues","Tauri","React","Code-Recherche","klare Dokumentation","Benutzeroberfläche","Suchtools","Erstellung von Problemen"],"pt":["criar issues no github","tauri e react","produtividade no github","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","criação de issues eficaz","github issues","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["создание issues на github","tauri и react","производительность на github","инструменты разработки","эффективное создание issues","github issues","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["إنشاء قضايا على github","tauri و react","الإنتاجية على github","أدوات التطوير","إنشاء قضايا فعال","github issues","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"StirlingMarketingGroup","repo":"marlin","repoPath":"StirlingMarketingGroup/marlin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.349Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"creating-github-issues","description":"Use when creating GitHub issues, making new issues, filing bugs, requesting features, or before running `gh issue create`. Triggers on new issue, create issue, file issue, gh issue, open issue. Ensures proper research, labels, and comprehensive issue documentation.","bodyPreview":"# Creating GitHub Issues\n\n## Overview\n\nEvery GitHub issue should be well-researched and clearly documented. This skill ensures issues contain enough context for anyone to understand and implement them.\n\n## Mandatory Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Research the Codebase\n\nBefore writing the issue, use the Explore agent or search tools to understand:\n\n- Where relevant code lives (file paths, functions, components)\n- How similar functionality is currently implemented\n- Database tables, API endpoints, or UI co","body":"# Creating GitHub Issues\n\n## Overview\n\nEvery GitHub issue should be well-researched and clearly documented. This skill ensures issues contain enough context for anyone to understand and implement them.\n\n## Mandatory Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Research the Codebase\n\nBefore writing the issue, use the Explore agent or search tools to understand:\n\n- Where relevant code lives (file paths, functions, components)\n- How similar functionality is currently implemented\n- Database tables, API endpoints, or UI components involved\n- Existing patterns that should be followed\n\n**Include in the issue:**\n- Specific file paths and line numbers\n- Code snippets showing current implementation\n- References to similar existing code as examples\n\n**Why:** Issues with research reduce back-and-forth questions and give implementers a head start.\n\n### Step 2: Create the Issue\n\nUse `gh issue create` with a well-structured body:\n\n```bash\ngh issue create --title \"Brief descriptive title\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n<1-3 sentences describing what needs to be done>\n\n## Current State\n<What exists now, with file paths and code references>\n\n## Proposed Changes\n<What should change, with specific details>\n\n## Technical Notes\n<File paths, database tables, API endpoints, code snippets>\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Specific testable requirement\n- [ ] Another requirement\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Add Labels\n\nDiscover current labels and apply appropriate ones:\n\n```bash\ngh label list --limit 50\n```\n\n**Common label categories:**\n\n1. **Type** (pick one):\n   - `enhancement` - New feature or improvement\n   - `bug` - Something isn''t working\n   - `documentation` - Documentation improvements\n   - `question` - Further information requested\n\n2. **Priority** (if applicable):\n   - `priority: critical` - Production broken, blocking issue\n   - `priority: high` - Important bug fix, urgent feature\n   - `priority: low` - Nice to have, can wait\n\n3. **Area** (if applicable):\n   - Labels indicating which part of the codebase is affected\n\n```bash\ngh issue edit <number> --add-label \"enhancement\"\n```\n\n### Step 4: Add to Project (if applicable)\n\nIf the repository uses GitHub Projects:\n\n```bash\ngh issue edit <number> --add-project \"Project Name\"\n```\n\n## Issue Template\n\n```markdown\n## Summary\n<1-3 sentences describing what needs to be done>\n\n## Current State\n<What exists now>\n- File: `path/to/file.ts:123`\n- Current behavior: <description>\n\n## Proposed Changes\n<What should change>\n1. Change X to do Y\n2. Add Z functionality\n\n## Technical Notes\n- Relevant files: `src/components/Feature.tsx`, `src/utils/helpers.ts`\n- Related functions: `handleSubmit()`, `validateInput()`\n- Consider: <architectural notes, edge cases>\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Specific testable requirement\n- [ ] Another requirement\n- [ ] Tests pass\n\n## Additional Context\n<Screenshots, error messages, related issues>\n```\n\n## Field Selection Guidelines\n\n### Priority\n- **Critical** - Production broken, blocking issue\n- **High** - Important bug fix, urgent feature (most bugs default here)\n- **Medium** - Standard feature work\n- **Low** - Nice to have, can wait\n\n**Default guidance:** Bugs default to High unless trivial. Enhancements default to Medium unless urgent.\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| Create issue without researching code first | Use Explore agent to find relevant files |\n| Generic issue description | Include specific file paths, line numbers, code snippets |\n| Missing acceptance criteria | Always include testable requirements |\n| No labels | Always add at least a type label |\n| Vague title | Make titles specific and searchable |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:42.292Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing to create well-documented GitHub issues with advanced research capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要创建具有高级研究能力的、文档齐全的 GitHub 问题的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが高度なリサーチ機能を備えた、ドキュメント化された GitHub の問題を作成する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 연구 기능을 갖춘 잘 문서화된 GitHub 문제를 생성해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan crear problemas de GitHub bien documentados con capacidades de investigación avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin de créer des problèmes GitHub bien documentés avec des capacités de recherche avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die gut dokumentierte GitHub-Probleme mit erweiterten Forschungsmöglichkeiten erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam criar problemas do GitHub bem documentados com capacidades de pesquisa avançadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимо создавать хорошо документированные проблемы GitHub с расширенными возможностями исследования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء مشاكل GitHub مدقت جيدًا بقدرات بحث متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality GitHub issues with sufficient context for implementation, utilizing Explore agents or search tools for in-depth research on codebases, including file paths, functions, components, and database tables.","zh":"赋予代理生成高质量的 GitHub 问题的能力，利用 Explore 代理或搜索工具对代码库进行深入研究，包括文件路径、函数、组件和数据库表。","ja":"エージェントが実装に十分なコンテキストを備えた高品質の GitHub の問題を生成できるようにし、コードベースの深入的なリサーチを行うために Explore エージェントまたは検索ツールを利用します。ファイルパス、関数、コンポーネント、データベーステーブルなどを含みます。","ko":"에이전트가 구현에 충분한 컨텍스트를 갖춘 고품질의 GitHub 문제를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 코드베이스에 대한 심도 있는 연구를 위해 Explore 에이전트 또는 검색 도구를 사용합니다. 파일 경로, 함수, 컴포넌트, 데이터베이스 테이블 등을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar problemas de GitHub de alta calidad con suficiente contexto para la implementación, utilizando agentes Explore o herramientas de búsqueda para una investigación en profundidad sobre los codebases, incluyendo rutas de archivo, funciones, componentes y tablas de base de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des problèmes GitHub de haute qualité avec un contexte suffisant pour la mise en œuvre, en utilisant des agents Explore ou des outils de recherche pour une recherche approfondie sur les codebases, y compris les chemins de fichiers, les fonctions, les composants et les tables de base de données.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, GitHub-Probleme hoher Qualität mit ausreichendem Kontext für die Implementierung zu generieren, indem sie Explore-Agents oder Suchwerkzeuge für eine gründliche Recherche auf Codebasen verwenden, einschließlich Dateipfade, Funktionen, Komponenten und Datenbanktabellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar problemas de alta qualidade do GitHub com contexto suficiente para implementação, utilizando agentes Explore ou ferramentas de busca para pesquisa aprofundada em codebases, incluindo caminhos de arquivo, funções, componentes e tabelas de banco de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать высококачественные проблемы GitHub с достаточным контекстом для реализации, используя агентов Explore или инструменты поиска для углубленного исследования кодовых баз, включая пути к файлам, функции, компоненты и таблицы баз данных.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء مشاكل GitHub عالية الجودة مع سياق كافٍ للتنفيذ، باستخدام عميل الاستكشاف أو أدوات البحث للبحث المتعمق في قواعد البيانات، بما في ذلك مسارات الملفات والوظائف والمكونات وجداول قاعدة البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Researching codebases for issue creation","Generating well-documented GitHub issues","Utilizing Explore agents for in-depth code research"],"zh":["研究代码库以创建问题","生成文档齐全的 GitHub 问题","利用 Explore 代理进行代码深入研究"],"ja":["問題作成のためのコードベースのリサーチ","ドキュメント化された GitHub の問題の生成","コードの深入的なリサーチのための Explore エージェントの利用"],"ko":["문제 생성을 위한 코드베이스 연구","잘 문서화된 GitHub 문제 생성","코드 심도 있는 연구를 위한 Explore 에이전트 사용"],"es":["Investigación de codebases para la creación de problemas","Generación de problemas de GitHub bien documentados","Utilización de agentes Explore para la investigación de código en profundidad"],"fr":["Recherche de codebases pour la création de problèmes","Génération de problèmes GitHub bien documentés","Utilisation d''agents Explore pour la recherche de code en profondeur"],"de":["Recherche von Codebasen für die Problemerstellung","Erstellung gut dokumentierter GitHub-Probleme","Verwendung von Explore-Agents für die Recherche von Code im Detail"],"pt":["Pesquisando codebases para criação de problemas","Gerando problemas do GitHub bem documentados","Utilizando agentes Explore para pesquisa de código aprofundada"],"ru":["Исследование кодовых баз для создания проблем","Генерация хорошо документированных проблем GitHub","Использование агентов Explore для углубленного исследования кода"],"ar":["البحث في قواعد البيانات لإنشاء مشاكل","إنشاء مشاكل GitHub مدقة جيدًا","استخدام عميل الاستكشاف للبحث المتعمق في Код"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to GitHub repository","Dependent on Explore agent or search tools for research"],"zh":["需要访问 GitHub 存储库","依赖于 Explore 代理或搜索工具进行研究"],"ja":["GitHub リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","リサーチのために Explore エージェントまたは検索ツールに依存"],"ko":["GitHub 저장소에 대한 액세스가 필요","연구를 위해 Explore 에이전트 또는 검색 도구에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de GitHub","Depende de los agentes Explore o herramientas de búsqueda para la investigación"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel GitHub","Dépend des agents Explore ou des outils de recherche pour la recherche"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das GitHub-Repository","Hängt von Explore-Agents oder Suchwerkzeugen für die Recherche ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório do GitHub","Dependente do agente Explore ou ferramentas de busca para pesquisa"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию GitHub","Зависит от агента Explore или инструментов поиска для исследования"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع GitHub","يعتمد على عميل الاستكشاف أو أدوات البحث للبحث"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"71bfe54535fcda7b4c12a92cda350db624add64831e1af9e9de885f5371b995c","qualityScore":42}');
