ecialized AI agents, following technical design rules for frontend development","zh":"前端技术规范是指使用TypeScript和React实现生产就绪的AI Agent的技术要求和标准","ja":"フロントエンド技術仕様とは、TypeScriptとReactを使用して生産就緒のAIエージェントを実現するための技術要件と規格のこと","ko":"프론트엔드 기술 사양은 TypeScript와 React를 사용하여 생산 준비가 된 AI 에이전트를 구현하기 위한 기술 요구 사항과 표준을 말합니다","es":"El frontend/technical-spec es un conjunto de reglas y patrones de diseño para la implementación de aplicaciones de frontend con TypeScript y React","fr":"Le frontend/technical-spec est un ensemble de règles et de modèles de conception pour la mise en œuvre d''applications de frontend avec TypeScript et React","de":"Das frontend/technical-spec ist eine Sammlung von Regeln und Designmustern für die Implementierung von Frontend-Anwendungen mit TypeScript und React","pt":"O que é frontend/technical-spec? É um boilerplate TypeScript para Claude Code com agentes de IA especializados","ru":"Что такое frontend/technical-spec? Это производственный шаблон TypeScript для Claude Code с оснасткой ИИ","ar":"ما هو بروتوكول frontend/technical-spec؟ هو قالب أساسي TypeScript ل Claude Code مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتخصصين"},"features":{"en":["TypeScript-based React application implementation","Environment variable management through configuration layer","Proper type safety with build tool''s environment variable system","Centrally managed environment variables for security","Architecture patterns selected according to project requirements and scale","Support for `process.env` alternative in browser environments"],"zh":["使用TypeScript实现生产就绪的AI Agent","基于React的应用程序实现","使用环境变量系统进行配置管理","实现适当的类型安全","支持多种架构模式"],"ja":["TypeScriptを使用して生産就緒のAIエージェントを実現","Reactベースのアプリケーション実装","環境変数システムを使用した構成管理","適切な型安全性の実現","複数のアーキテクチャパターンのサポート"],"ko":["TypeScript를 사용하여 생산 준비가 된 AI 에이전트를 구현","React 기반의 애플리케이션 구현","환경 변수 시스템을 사용한 구성 관리","적절한 유형 안전성을 구현","여러 가지 아키텍처 패턴 지원"],"es":["Arquitectura de aplicación basada en TypeScript y React","Gestión de variables de entorno a través de una capa de configuración","Seguridad de variables de entorno con tipo de seguridad adecuado","Patrones de diseño seleccionados según los requisitos del proyecto y la escala","Uso del sistema de variables de entorno de la herramienta de compilación"],"fr":["Architecture d''application basée sur TypeScript et React","Gestion des variables d''environnement via une couche de configuration","Sécurité des variables d''environnement avec un type de sécurité approprié","Modèles de conception sélectionnés en fonction des besoins du projet et de l''échelle","Utilisation du système de variables d''environnement de l''outil de construction"],"de":["Anwendungsarchitektur basierend auf TypeScript und React","Verwaltung von Umgebungsvariablen über eine Konfigurationsebene","Sicherheit von Umgebungsvariablen mit geeigneter Sicherheitstyp","Entwurfsmuster ausgewählt nach Projektanforderungen und Größe","Verwendung des Umgebungsvariablen-Systems der Build-Tool"],"pt":["Implementação de aplicativos React com TypeScript","Gestão de variáveis de ambiente com segurança","Arquitetura escalável com padrões de design","Integração com agentes de IA especializados","Tipagem segura com TypeScript"],"ru":["Реализация приложений React с TypeScript","Управление переменными среды с безопасностью","Масштабируемая архитектура с шаблонами проектирования","Интеграция с оснасткой ИИ","Безопасная типизация с TypeScript"],"ar":["تنفيذ تطبيقات React مع TypeScript","إدارة متغيرات البيئة مع الأمان","هيكلة قابلة للتوسع مع أنماط التصميم","التكامل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتخصصين","التحقق من الأمان مع TypeScript"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use frontend/technical-spec","frontend/technical-spec alternative","TypeScript boilerplate for Claude Code","frontend/technical-spec setup guide","environment variable management in React","frontend/technical-spec vs create-react-app","TypeScript-based AI agent development","Claude Code development best practices","frontend/technical-spec install"],"zh":["前端技术规范","TypeScript AI Agent","React应用程序","环境变量系统","类型安全","架构模式","AI开发","前端开发","TypeScript开发"],"ja":["フロントエンド技術仕様","AIエージェント","Reactアプリケーション","環境変数システム","型安全","アーキテクチャパターン","AI開発","フロントエンド開発","TypeScript開発"],"ko":["프론트엔드 기술 사양","AI 에이전트","React 애플리케이션","환경 변수 시스템","형 안전","아키텍처 패턴","AI 개발","프론트엔드 개발","TypeScript 개발"],"es":["frontend/technical-spec","Agentes de AI","TypeScript","React","boilerplate de producción","variables de entorno","seguridad de variables de entorno","patrones de diseño de frontend"],"fr":["frontend/technical-spec","Outils d''Intelligence Artificielle","TypeScript","React","modèle de démarrage de production","variables d''environnement","sécurité des variables d''environnement","modèles de conception de frontend"],"de":["frontend/technical-spec","KI-Agents","TypeScript","React","produktionsreifes Boilerplate","Umgebungsvariablen","Sicherheit von Umgebungsvariablen","Frontend-Entwurfsmuster"],"pt":["frontend/technical-spec","boilerplate TypeScript","Claude Code","agentes de IA","aplicativos React","TypeScript","gestão de variáveis de ambiente","arquitetura escalável","segurança"],"ru":["frontend/technical-spec","производственный шаблон TypeScript","Claude Code","ИИ Агенты","приложения React","TypeScript","управление переменными среды","масштабируемая архитектура","безопасность"],"ar":["بروتوكول frontend/technical-spec","قالب أساسي TypeScript","Claude Code","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطبيقات React","TypeScript","إدارة متغيرات البيئة","هيكلة قابلة للتوسع","الأمان"]}},"owner":"shinpr","repo":"ai-coding-project-boilerplate","repoPath":"shinpr/ai-coding-project-boilerplate","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.357Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend/technical-spec","description":"Defines frontend environment variables, component design, and data flow patterns. Use when configuring React environment.","bodyPreview":"# Technical Design Rules (Frontend)\n\n## Basic Technology Stack Policy\nTypeScript-based React application implementation. Architecture patterns should be selected according to project requirements and scale.\n\n## Environment Variable Management and Security\n\n### Environment Variable Management\n- **Use build tool''s environment variable system**: `process.env` does not work in browser environments\n- Centrally manage environment variables through configuration layer\n- Implement proper type safety wit","body":"# Technical Design Rules (Frontend)\n\n## Basic Technology Stack Policy\nTypeScript-based React application implementation. Architecture patterns should be selected according to project requirements and scale.\n\n## Environment Variable Management and Security\n\n### Environment Variable Management\n- **Use build tool''s environment variable system**: `process.env` does not work in browser environments\n- Centrally manage environment variables through configuration layer\n- Implement proper type safety with TypeScript\n- Properly implement default value settings and mandatory checks\n\n```typescript\n// Build tool environment variables (public values only)\nconst config = {\n  apiUrl: import.meta.env.API_URL || ''http://localhost:3000'',\n  appName: import.meta.env.APP_NAME || ''My App''\n}\n\n// Does not work in frontend\nconst apiUrl = process.env.API_URL\n```\n\n### Security (Client-side Constraints)\n- **CRITICAL**: All frontend code is public and visible in browser\n- **Never store secrets client-side**: No API keys, tokens, or secrets in environment variables\n- Do not include `.env` files in Git (same as backend)\n- Prohibit logging of sensitive information (passwords, tokens, personal data)\n- Do not include sensitive information in error messages\n\n**Correct Approach for Secrets**:\n```typescript\n// Security risk: API key exposed in browser\nconst apiKey = import.meta.env.API_KEY\nconst response = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/data?key=${apiKey}`)\n\n// Correct: Backend manages secrets, frontend accesses via proxy\nconst response = await fetch(''/api/data'') // Backend handles API key authentication\n```\n\n## Architecture Design\n\n### Frontend Architecture Patterns\n\n**React Component Architecture**:\n- **Function Components**: Mandatory, class components deprecated\n- **Custom Hooks**: For logic reuse and dependency injection\n- **Component Hierarchy**: Atoms -> Molecules -> Organisms -> Templates -> Pages\n- **Props-driven**: Components receive all necessary data via props\n- **Co-location**: Place tests, styles, and related files alongside components\n\n**State Management Patterns**:\n- **Local State**: `useState` for component-specific state\n- **Context API**: For sharing state across component tree (theme, auth, etc.)\n- **Custom Hooks**: Encapsulate state logic and side effects\n- **Server State**: React Query or SWR for API data caching\n\n## Unified Data Flow Principles\n\n### Client-side Data Flow\nMaintain consistent data flow throughout the React application:\n\n- **Single Source of Truth**: Each piece of state has one authoritative source\n  - UI state: Component state or Context\n  - Server data: API responses cached in React Query/SWR\n  - Form data: Controlled components with React Hook Form\n\n- **Unidirectional Flow**: Data flows top-down via props\n  ```\n  API Response -> State -> Props -> Render -> UI\n  User Input -> Event Handler -> State Update -> Re-render\n  ```\n\n- **Immutable Updates**: Use immutable patterns for state updates\n  ```typescript\n  // Immutable state update\n  setUsers(prev => [...prev, newUser])\n\n  // Mutable state update (avoid)\n  users.push(newUser)\n  setUsers(users)\n  ```\n\n### Type Safety in Data Flow\n- **Frontend -> Backend**: Props/State (Type Guaranteed) -> API Request (Serialization)\n- **Backend -> Frontend**: API Response (`unknown`) -> Type Guard -> State (Type Guaranteed)\n\n```typescript\n// Type-safe data flow\nasync function fetchUser(id: string): Promise<User> {\n  const response = await fetch(`/api/users/${id}`)\n  const data: unknown = await response.json()\n\n  if (!isUser(data)) {\n    throw new Error(''Invalid user data'')\n  }\n\n  return data // Type guaranteed as User\n}\n```\n\n## Build and Testing\nUse the appropriate run command based on the `packageManager` field in package.json.\n\n### Build Commands\n- `dev` - Development server\n- `build` - Production build\n- `preview` - Preview production build\n- `type-check` - Type check (no emit)\n\n### Testing Commands\n- `test` - Run tests\n- `test:coverage` - Run tests with coverage\n- `test:coverage:fresh` - Run tests with coverage (fresh cache)\n- `test:safe` - Safe test execution (with auto cleanup)\n- `cleanup:processes` - Cleanup Vitest processes\n\n### Quality Check Requirements\nQuality checks are mandatory upon implementation completion:\n\n**Phase 1-3: Basic Checks**\n- `check` - Biome (lint + format)\n- `build` - TypeScript build\n\n**Phase 4-5: Tests and Final Confirmation**\n- `test` - Test execution\n- `test:coverage:fresh` - Coverage measurement\n- `check:all` - Overall integrated check\n\n### Coverage Requirements\n- **Mandatory**: Unit test coverage must be 60% or higher\n- **Component-specific targets**:\n  - Atoms: 70% or higher\n  - Molecules: 65% or higher\n  - Organisms: 60% or higher\n  - Custom Hooks: 65% or higher\n  - Utils: 70% or higher\n\n### Non-functional Requirements\n- **Browser Compatibility**: Chrome/Firefox/Safari/Edge (latest 2 versions)\n- **Rendering Time**: Within 5 seconds for major pages\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:05.071Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code needing robust frontend implementation with TypeScript-based React application and secure environment variable management.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的前端实现和安全环境变量管理的AI代理，如Claude Code，使用TypeScript-based React应用程序。","ja":"Claude Codeのようなロバストなフロントエンド実装とセキュアな環境変数管理が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。TypeScriptベースのReactアプリケーションを使用します。","ko":"Claude Code와 같은 강력한 프론트엔드 구현 및 안전한 환경 변수 관리가 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. TypeScript 기반의 React 애플리케이션을 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de AI como Claude Code que necesitan una implementación de frontend robusta con aplicación React basada en TypeScript y gestión segura de variables de entorno.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA comme Claude Code ayant besoin d''une mise en œuvre de frontend robuste avec une application React basée sur TypeScript et une gestion sécurisée des variables d''environnement.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, die eine robuste Frontend-Implementierung mit einer TypeScript-basierten React-Anwendung und einer sicheren Umgebungsvariablenverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude Code que precisam de uma implementação de frontend robusta com aplicação React baseada em TypeScript e gerenciamento de variáveis de ambiente seguro.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, требующих надежной реализации frontend с помощью приложения React на основе TypeScript и безопасного управления переменными среды.","ar":"مثالي لعمال الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ واجهة مستخدم قوي مع تطبيق React المبني على TypeScript وإدارة متغيرات البيئة الآمنة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement secure and scalable frontend applications using TypeScript and React, with features like centralized environment variable management through configuration layers and proper type safety, leveraging build tool''s environment variable system for secure data handling.","zh":"赋予代理实现安全和可扩展的前端应用程序的能力，使用TypeScript和React，具有集中环境变量管理、配置层和适当的类型安全等功能，利用构建工具的环境变量系统进行安全数据处理。","ja":"TypeScriptとReactを使用して、セキュアでスケーラブルなフロントエンドアプリケーションを実装するエージェントの能力を提供します。中央の環境変数管理、構成レイヤー、適切な型セーフティなどの機能を備えており、ビルドツールの環境変数システムを使用してセキュアなデータ処理を実現します。","ko":"TypeScript와 React를 사용하여 보안이 뛰어난 확장 가능한 프론트엔드 애플리케이션을 구현할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다. 중앙 환경 변수 관리, 구성 계층 및 적절한 유형 안전과 같은 기능을 갖추고 있으며, 빌드 도구의 환경 변수 시스템을 사용하여 보안 데이터 처리를 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar aplicaciones de frontend seguras y escalables utilizando TypeScript y React, con características como la gestión centralizada de variables de entorno a través de capas de configuración y una adecuada seguridad de tipos, aprovechando el sistema de variables de entorno de la herramienta de compilación para el manejo seguro de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des applications de frontend sécurisées et évolutives en utilisant TypeScript et React, avec des fonctionnalités comme la gestion centralisée des variables d''environnement via des couches de configuration et une sécurité de type appropriée, en exploitant le système de variables d''environnement de l''outil de construction pour la gestion sécurisée des données.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, sichere und skalierbare Frontend-Anwendungen mit TypeScript und React zu implementieren, mit Funktionen wie zentraler Umgebungsvariablenverwaltung durch Konfigurationsebenen und ordnungsgemäßer Typsicherheit, indem es das Umgebungsvariablen-System der Build-Tool für sichere Datenverarbeitung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar aplicações de frontend seguras e escaláveis usando TypeScript e React, com recursos como gerenciamento centralizado de variáveis de ambiente por meio de camadas de configuração e segurança de tipo adequada, aproveitando o sistema de variáveis de ambiente da ferramenta de compilação para manipulação de dados segura.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать безопасные и масштабируемые frontend-приложения, используя TypeScript и React, с функциями, такими как централизованное управление переменными среды через конфигурационные слои и правильная безопасность типов, используя систему переменных среды инструмента сборки для безопасной обработки данных.","ar":"تمكن العمال من تنفيذ تطبيقات واجهة المستخدم الآمنة والموسعة باستخدام TypeScript و React، مع ميزات مثل إدارة متغيرات البيئة المركزية من خلال طبقات التكوين وأمان النوع المناسب، واستخدام نظام متغيرات البيئة لأداة البناء لمعالجة البيانات الآمنة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing secure environment variable management for AI agent applications","Building scalable TypeScript-based React applications for Claude Code","Ensuring proper type safety in frontend application development","Centrally managing environment variables for multiple AI agent projects"],"zh":["为AI代理应用程序实现安全的环境变量管理","构建可扩展的TypeScript-based React应用程序，用于Claude Code","在前端应用程序开发中确保适当的类型安全","集中管理多个AI代理项目的环境变量"],"ja":["AIエージェントアプリケーションのセキュアな環境変数管理を実装する","Claude Code用のスケーラブルなTypeScriptベースのReactアプリケーションを構築する","フロントエンドアプリケーション開発で適切な型セーフティを確保する","複数のAIエージェントプロジェクトの環境変数を中央管理する"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 애플리케이션에 대한 보안 환경 변수 관리를 구현하는 것","Claude Code를 위한 확장 가능한 TypeScript 기반의 React 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","프론트엔드 애플리케이션 개발에서 적절한 유형 안전을 보장하는 것","여러 개의 AI 에이전트 프로젝트에 대한 환경 변수를 중앙에서 관리하는 것"],"es":["Implementar una gestión segura de variables de entorno para aplicaciones de agentes de AI","Crear aplicaciones React escalables basadas en TypeScript para Claude Code","Garantizar la seguridad de tipos adecuada en el desarrollo de aplicaciones de frontend","Gestionar centralmente variables de entorno para múltiples proyectos de agentes de AI"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre une gestion sécurisée des variables d''environnement pour les applications d''agents d''IA","Construire des applications React évolutives basées sur TypeScript pour Claude Code","Assurer une sécurité de type appropriée dans le développement d''applications de frontend","Gérer de manière centralisée les variables d''environnement pour plusieurs projets d''agents d''IA"],"de":["Eine sichere Umgebungsvariablenverwaltung für KI-Agent-Anwendungen implementieren","Skalierbare TypeScript-basierte React-Anwendungen für Claude Code erstellen","Eine ordnungsgemäße Typsicherheit in der Frontend-Anwendungsentwicklung sicherstellen","Umgebungsvariablen für mehrere KI-Agent-Projekte zentral verwalten"],"pt":["Implementar gerenciamento de variáveis de ambiente seguro para aplicações de agentes de IA","Construir aplicações React baseadas em TypeScript escaláveis para Claude Code","Garantir segurança de tipo adequada no desenvolvimento de aplicações de frontend","Gerenciar centralmente variáveis de ambiente para múltiplos projetos de agentes de IA"],"ru":["Реализовать безопасное управление переменными среды для приложений агентов ИИ","Создавать масштабируемые приложения React на основе TypeScript для Claude Code","Обеспечить правильную безопасность типов при разработке frontend-приложений","Централизованно управлять переменными среды для нескольких проектов агентов ИИ"],"ar":["تنفيذ إدارة متغيرات البيئة الآمنة لتطبيقات عمال الذكاء الاصطناعي","بناء تطبيقات React المبنية على TypeScript القابلة للتوسيع لبرنامج Claude Code","ضمان أمان النوع المناسب في تطوير تطبيقات واجهة المستخدم","إدارة متغيرات البيئة بشكل مركزي لمشاريع عمال الذكاء الاصطناعي المتعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript and React expertise","Limited to browser environments due to process.env limitations","Dependent on build tool''s environment variable system"],"zh":["需要TypeScript和React的专业知识","由于process.env限制，仅限于浏览器环境","依赖于构建工具的环境变量系统"],"ja":["TypeScriptとReactの専門知識が必要","process.envの制限により、ブラウザ環境のみ","ビルドツールの環境変数システムに依存する"],"ko":["TypeScript와 React에 대한 전문 지식이 필요합니다.","process.env의 제한으로 인해 브라우저 환경만 해당합니다.","빌드 도구의 환경 변수 시스템에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere experiencia en TypeScript y React","Limitado a entornos de navegador debido a las limitaciones de process.env","Dependiente del sistema de variables de entorno de la herramienta de compilación"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en TypeScript et React","Limité aux environnements de navigateur en raison des limitations de process.env","Dépendant du système de variables d''environnement de l''outil de construction"],"de":["Benötigt TypeScript- und React-Expertise","Auf Browserumgebungen beschränkt aufgrund der Einschränkungen von process.env","Abhängig vom Umgebungsvariablen-System der Build-Tool"],"pt":["Exige expertise em TypeScript e React","Limitado a ambientes de navegador devido a limitações do process.env","Dependente do sistema de variáveis de ambiente da ferramenta de compilação"],"ru":["Требует экспертизы в области TypeScript и React","Ограничен браузерными средами из-за ограничений process.env","Зависит от системы переменных среды инструмента сборки"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في TypeScript و React","محدود بالبيئات المتصفحة بسبب قيود process.env","يعتمد على نظام متغيرات البيئة لأداة البناء"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"937e2cfdee77b770521c82244527ea42f982b06ccc15cd701b1bf52fbe8c4ed4","qualityScore":42}');
