ge-handler es una habilidad que agrega un controlador de mensajes a NodeBridge para mejorar la comunicación entre la UI y el backend.","fr":"Add-nodebridge-handler est une compétence qui ajoute un gestionnaire de messages à NodeBridge pour améliorer la communication entre la UI et le backend.","de":"Add-nodebridge-handler ist eine Fähigkeit, die einen Nachrichtenhandler zu NodeBridge hinzufügt, um die Kommunikation zwischen der UI und dem Backend zu verbessern.","pt":"O que é Add NodeBridge Handler? É uma habilidade que permite estender o sistema NodeBridge com manipuladores de mensagens personalizados","ru":"Что такое Add NodeBridge Handler? Это навык, который позволяет расширить систему NodeBridge пользовательскими обработчиками сообщений","ar":"ما هو معالج إضافة NodeBridge؟ هو مهارة تسمح بتمديد نظام NodeBridge بمعالجات رسائل مخصصة"},"features":{"en":["Adds handler implementation in src/nodeBridge.ts","Registers handlers using the registerHandlers() method in NodeHandlerRegistry class","Supports message handling between UI layer and Node.js backend","Utilizes the messageBus.registerHandler() function for handler registration","Enables communication between UI and backend using NodeBridge"],"zh":["添加处理程序实现到src/nodeBridge.ts","使用registerHandlers()方法注册处理程序","支持UI层和Node.js后端之间的通信","使用messageBus.registerHandler()方法处理消息","支持异步处理"],"ja":["src/nodeBridge.tsにハンドラー実装を追加","registerHandlers()メソッドを使用してハンドラーを登録","UI層とNode.jsバックエンドの間の通信をサポート","messageBus.registerHandler()メソッドを使用してメッセージを処理","非同期処理をサポート"],"ko":["src/nodeBridge.ts에 핸들러 구현을 추가","registerHandlers() 메서드를 사용하여 핸들러를 등록","UI 계층과 Node.js 백엔드 간의 통신을 지원","messageBus.registerHandler() 메서드를 사용하여 메시지를 처리","비동기 처리를 지원"],"es":["Agregar un controlador de mensajes a NodeBridge","Mejorar la comunicación entre la capa de UI y el backend de Node.js","Utilizar TypeScript para implementar el controlador","Registrar el controlador en el método registerHandlers()","Utilizar el mensaje de datos para procesar la solicitud"],"fr":["Ajouter un gestionnaire de messages à NodeBridge","Améliorer la communication entre la couche UI et le backend Node.js","Utiliser TypeScript pour implémenter le gestionnaire","Enregistrer le gestionnaire dans la méthode registerHandlers()","Utiliser le message de données pour traiter la requête"],"de":["Einen Nachrichtenhandler zu NodeBridge hinzufügen","Die Kommunikation zwischen der UI-Schicht und dem Node.js-Backend verbessern","TypeScript verwenden, um den Handler zu implementieren","Den Handler im registerHandlers()-Methoden registrieren","Die Nachrichtendaten verwenden, um die Anfrage zu verarbeiten"],"pt":["Adicione manipuladores de mensagens personalizados ao sistema NodeBridge","Estenda o sistema NodeBridge com funcionalidades personalizadas","Use a classe NodeHandlerRegistry para registrar manipuladores de mensagens","Trabalhe com a biblioteca messageBus para gerenciar mensagens","Desenvolva aplicações personalizadas com o Node.js e o sistema NodeBridge"],"ru":["Добавьте пользовательские обработчики сообщений в систему NodeBridge","Расширьте систему NodeBridge с помощью пользовательских функций","Используйте класс NodeHandlerRegistry для регистрации обработчиков сообщений","Работайте с библиотекой messageBus для управления сообщениями","Разрабатывайте пользовательские приложения с помощью Node.js и системы NodeBridge"],"ar":["أضف معالجات رسائل مخصصة إلى نظام NodeBridge","امتد نظام NodeBridge مع ميزات مخصصة","استخدم فئة NodeHandlerRegistry لتسجيل معالجات الرسائل","اعمل مع مكتبة messageBus لإدارة الرسائل","طور تطبيقات مخصصة مع Node.js ونظام NodeBridge"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use add-nodebridge-handler","add-nodebridge-handler setup guide","NodeBridge message handler","add-nodebridge-handler alternative","Node.js backend communication","add-nodebridge-handler install","what is add-nodebridge-handler","NodeBridge UI layer communication","add-nodebridge-handler vs other handlers"],"zh":["NodeBridge处理程序","添加处理程序","UI层和Node.js后端通信","messageBus.registerHandler()","异步处理","Node.js开发","AI工具","代码生成"],"ja":["NodeBridgeハンドラー","ハンドラーの追加","UI層とNode.jsバックエンドの通信","messageBus.registerHandler()","非同期処理","Node.js開発","AIエージェント","コード生成"],"ko":["NodeBridge 핸들러","핸들러 추가","UI 계층과 Node.js 백엔드 간의 통신","messageBus.registerHandler()","비동기 처리","Node.js 개발","AI 도구","코드 생성"],"es":["add-nodebridge-handler","NodeBridge","controlador de mensajes","comunicación entre UI y backend","TypeScript","registerHandlers","mensaje de datos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["add-nodebridge-handler","NodeBridge","gestionnaire de messages","communication entre UI et backend","TypeScript","registerHandlers","message de données","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","agents d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["add-nodebridge-handler","NodeBridge","Nachrichtenhandler","Kommunikation zwischen UI und Backend","TypeScript","registerHandlers","Nachrichtendaten","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Künstliche Intelligenz Tools"],"pt":["Add NodeBridge Handler","NodeBridge","manipuladores de mensagens","Node.js","desenvolvimento de aplicações","biblioteca messageBus","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","tecnologias de desenvolvimento","programação em Node.js"],"ru":["Add NodeBridge Handler","NodeBridge","обработчики сообщений","Node.js","разработка приложений","библиотека messageBus","инструменты разработки","технологии разработки","программирование на Node.js"],"ar":["معالج إضافة NodeBridge","نظام NodeBridge","معالجات الرسائل","Node.js","تطوير التطبيقات","مكتبة messageBus","أدوات التطوير","تقنيات التطوير","برمجة Node.js"]}},"owner":"neovateai","repo":"neovate-code","repoPath":"neovateai/neovate-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-nodebridge-handler","description":"Use this skill when adding a new NodeBridge handler to src/nodeBridge.ts, including updating types in src/nodeBridge.types.ts and optionally testing with scripts/test-nodebridge.ts","bodyPreview":"# Add NodeBridge Handler\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill guides the process of adding a new message handler to the NodeBridge system, which enables communication between the UI layer and the Node.js backend.\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Add Handler Implementation in `src/nodeBridge.ts`\n\nLocate the `registerHandlers()` method in the `NodeHandlerRegistry` class and add your handler:\n\n```typescript\nthis.messageBus.registerHandler(''category.handlerName'', async (data) => {\n  const { cwd, ...otherParams } = data;\n  con","body":"# Add NodeBridge Handler\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill guides the process of adding a new message handler to the NodeBridge system, which enables communication between the UI layer and the Node.js backend.\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Add Handler Implementation in `src/nodeBridge.ts`\n\nLocate the `registerHandlers()` method in the `NodeHandlerRegistry` class and add your handler:\n\n```typescript\nthis.messageBus.registerHandler(''category.handlerName'', async (data) => {\n  const { cwd, ...otherParams } = data;\n  const context = await this.getContext(cwd);\n  \n  // Implementation logic here\n  \n  return {\n    success: true,\n    data: {\n      // Return data\n    },\n  };\n});\n```\n\n**Handler Naming Convention:**\n- Use dot notation: `category.action` (e.g., `git.status`, `session.send`, `utils.getPaths`)\n- Categories: `config`, `git`, `mcp`, `models`, `outputStyles`, `project`, `projects`, `providers`, `session`, `sessions`, `slashCommand`, `status`, `utils`\n\n**Common Patterns:**\n- Always get context via `await this.getContext(cwd)`\n- Return `{ success: true, data: {...} }` for success\n- Return `{ success: false, error: ''message'' }` for errors\n- Wrap in try/catch for error handling\n\n### 2. Add Type Definitions in `src/nodeBridge.types.ts`\n\nAdd input and output types near the relevant section:\n\n```typescript\n// ============================================================================\n// Category Handlers\n// ============================================================================\n\ntype CategoryHandlerNameInput = {\n  cwd: string;\n  // other required params\n  optionalParam?: string;\n};\n\ntype CategoryHandlerNameOutput = {\n  success: boolean;\n  error?: string;\n  data?: {\n    // return data shape\n  };\n};\n```\n\nThen add to the `HandlerMap` type:\n\n```typescript\nexport type HandlerMap = {\n  // ... existing handlers\n  \n  // Category handlers\n  ''category.handlerName'': {\n    input: CategoryHandlerNameInput;\n    output: CategoryHandlerNameOutput;\n  };\n};\n```\n\n### 3. (Optional) Add to Test Script\n\nUpdate `scripts/test-nodebridge.ts` HANDLERS object if the handler should be easily testable:\n\n```typescript\nconst HANDLERS: Record<string, string> = {\n  // ... existing handlers\n  ''category.handlerName'': ''Description of what this handler does'',\n};\n```\n\n### 4. Test the Handler\n\nRun the test script:\n\n```bash\nbun scripts/test-nodebridge.ts category.handlerName --cwd=/path/to/dir --param=value\n```\n\nOr with JSON data:\n\n```bash\nbun scripts/test-nodebridge.ts category.handlerName --data=''{\"cwd\":\"/path\",\"param\":\"value\"}''\n```\n\n## Example: Complete Handler Addition\n\n### nodeBridge.ts\n```typescript\nthis.messageBus.registerHandler(''utils.example'', async (data) => {\n  const { cwd, name } = data;\n  try {\n    const context = await this.getContext(cwd);\n    \n    // Do something with context and params\n    const result = await someOperation(name);\n    \n    return {\n      success: true,\n      data: {\n        result,\n      },\n    };\n  } catch (error: any) {\n    return {\n      success: false,\n      error: error.message || ''Failed to execute example'',\n    };\n  }\n});\n```\n\n### nodeBridge.types.ts\n```typescript\ntype UtilsExampleInput = {\n  cwd: string;\n  name: string;\n};\n\ntype UtilsExampleOutput = {\n  success: boolean;\n  error?: string;\n  data?: {\n    result: string;\n  };\n};\n\n// In HandlerMap:\n''utils.example'': {\n  input: UtilsExampleInput;\n  output: UtilsExampleOutput;\n};\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Handlers are async functions that receive `data` parameter\n- Use `this.getContext(cwd)` to get the Context instance (cached per cwd)\n- Context provides access to: `config`, `paths`, `mcpManager`, `productName`, `version`, etc.\n- For long-running operations, consider using abort controllers (see `git.clone` pattern)\n- For operations that emit progress, use `this.messageBus.emitEvent()` (see `git.commit.output` pattern)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:04.565Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Node.js Agents needing enhanced UI-backend communication through NodeBridge","zh":"非常适合需要通过NodeBridge增强UI后端通信的Node.js代理","ja":"NodeBridgeを介したUIバックエンド通信を強化する必要があるNode.jsエージェントに最適","ko":"NodeBridge를 통해 UI 백엔드 통신을 강화해야 하는 Node.js 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Node.js que necesitan una comunicación mejorada entre la interfaz de usuario y el backend a través de NodeBridge","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Node.js qui nécessitent une communication améliorée entre l''interface utilisateur et le backend via NodeBridge","de":"Perfekt für Node.js-Agents, die eine verbesserte Kommunikation zwischen der Benutzeroberfläche und dem Backend über NodeBridge benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Node.js que precisam de comunicação UI-backend aprimorada por meio do NodeBridge","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Node.js, требующих улучшения коммуникации между UI и backend с помощью NodeBridge","ar":"مثالي لعميل Node.js الذي يحتاج إلى تعزيز اتصال واجهة المستخدم الخلفية من خلال NodeBridge"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extend NodeBridge functionality by registering custom message handlers, facilitating seamless communication between the UI layer and Node.js backend using the messageBus and NodeHandlerRegistry","zh":"赋予代理扩展NodeBridge功能的能力，通过注册自定义消息处理程序，实现UI层和Node.js后端之间的无缝通信，使用messageBus和NodeHandlerRegistry","ja":"エージェントにNodeBridgeの機能を拡張する能力を与え、カスタムメッセージハンドラーを登録し、messageBusとNodeHandlerRegistryを使用してUI層とNode.jsバックエンドの間にシームレスな通信を実現","ko":"에이전트가 NodeBridge 기능을 확장할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 사용자 지정 메시지 처리기를 등록하고 messageBus 및 NodeHandlerRegistry를 사용하여 UI 계층과 Node.js 백엔드 간의 무결점 통신을 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ampliar la funcionalidad de NodeBridge mediante el registro de controladores de mensajes personalizados, lo que facilita una comunicación fluida entre la capa de interfaz de usuario y el backend de Node.js utilizando el messageBus y NodeHandlerRegistry","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre les fonctionnalités de NodeBridge en enregistrant des gestionnaires de messages personnalisés, facilitant ainsi une communication fluide entre la couche d''interface utilisateur et le backend Node.js en utilisant le messageBus et NodeHandlerRegistry","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Funktionalität von NodeBridge durch die Registrierung von benutzerdefinierten Nachrichtenhandlern zu erweitern, wodurch eine nahtlose Kommunikation zwischen der Benutzeroberflächenschicht und dem Node.js-Backend mithilfe des messageBus und NodeHandlerRegistry ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estender a funcionalidade do NodeBridge registrando manipuladores de mensagens personalizados, facilitando a comunicação sem problemas entre a camada UI e o backend Node.js usando o messageBus e o NodeHandlerRegistry","ru":"Позволяет агентам расширять функциональность NodeBridge, регистрируя пользовательские обработчики сообщений, облегчая бесперебойную связь между слоем UI и backend Node.js с помощью messageBus и NodeHandlerRegistry","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من توسيع وظائف NodeBridge عن طريق تسجيل معالجات رسائل مخصصة، وتسهيل التواصل السلس بين طبقة واجهة المستخدم وخلفية Node.js باستخدام messageBus وسجل NodeHandler"},"useCases":{"en":["Registering custom message handlers for NodeBridge","Enhancing UI-backend communication in Node.js applications","Implementing asynchronous data processing using NodeBridge handlers"],"zh":["为NodeBridge注册自定义消息处理程序","增强Node.js应用程序中的UI后端通信","使用NodeBridge处理程序实现异步数据处理"],"ja":["NodeBridgeにカスタムメッセージハンドラーを登録する","Node.jsアプリケーションのUIバックエンド通信を強化する","NodeBridgeハンドラーを使用して非同期データ処理を実装する"],"ko":["NodeBridge에 사용자 지정 메시지 처리기를 등록","Node.js 애플리케이션의 UI 백엔드 통신을 강화","NodeBridge 처리기를 사용하여 비동기 데이터 처리를 구현"],"es":["Registro de controladores de mensajes personalizados para NodeBridge","Mejora de la comunicación entre la interfaz de usuario y el backend en aplicaciones Node.js","Implementación de procesamiento de datos asíncronos utilizando controladores de NodeBridge"],"fr":["Enregistrement de gestionnaires de messages personnalisés pour NodeBridge","Amélioration de la communication entre l''interface utilisateur et le backend dans les applications Node.js","Mise en œuvre d''un traitement de données asynchrone en utilisant les gestionnaires de NodeBridge"],"de":["Registrierung von benutzerdefinierten Nachrichtenhandlern für NodeBridge","Verbesserung der Kommunikation zwischen der Benutzeroberfläche und dem Backend in Node.js-Anwendungen","Implementierung der asynchronen Datenverarbeitung mithilfe von NodeBridge-Handlern"],"pt":["Registro de manipuladores de mensagens personalizados para NodeBridge","Melhoria da comunicação UI-backend em aplicações Node.js","Implementação de processamento de dados assíncrono usando manipuladores NodeBridge"],"ru":["Регистрация пользовательских обработчиков сообщений для NodeBridge","Улучшение коммуникации между UI и backend в приложениях Node.js","Реализация асинхронной обработки данных с помощью обработчиков NodeBridge"],"ar":["تسجيل معالجات رسائل مخصصة ل NodeBridge","تحسين اتصال واجهة المستخدم الخلفية في تطبيقات Node.js","تنفيذ معالجة البيانات غير المتزامنة باستخدام معالجات NodeBridge"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires NodeBridge and Node.js setup","Limited to TypeScript implementation in src/nodeBridge.ts"],"zh":["需要NodeBridge和Node.js设置","仅限于src/nodeBridge.ts中的TypeScript实现"],"ja":["NodeBridgeとNode.jsの設定が必要","src/nodeBridge.ts内のTypeScript実装に限定"],"ko":["NodeBridge 및 Node.js 설정이 필요","src/no